    "descriptionModule": {
      "briefSummary": "The purpose of this study is to measure decreases in daytime sleepiness, cataplexy (sudden loss of muscle tone), and disease symptoms in participants with NT1 when taking ALKS 2680 tablets compared with placebo tablets."
    },
